34276::$$$message_0262_0000_0000$$$::"Could you make some time to come over to my house?[lr]::
34277::$$$message_0262_0000_0001$$$::...There's something I want to show you, Senpai."[lr]::
34278::$$$message_0262_0000_0002$$$::When did Sakura say that?[lr]::
34279::$$$message_0262_0000_0003$$$::I've been so buy lately that I haven't been over to the Matous', so I decided to use my day off to go visit one morning.::
34280::$$$message_0262_0001_0000$$$::The treetops and trunks are colored white.[lr]::
34281::$$$message_0262_0001_0001$$$::They strike a dazzling, light red floral pattern.::
34282::$$$message_0262_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
34283::$$$message_0262_0002_0001$$$::...What a surprise.[lr]::
34284::$$$message_0262_0002_0002$$$::It's been about five years since I started visiting the Matou residence.[lr]::
34285::$$$message_0262_0002_0003$$$::The trees in the garden have never bloomed before, but now it's like they've been reborn in full bloom.::
34286::$$$message_0262_0003_0000$$$::"Oh, Senpai! Thank you for coming!"[lr]::
