34288::$$$message_0262_0003_0002$$$::Her smile seems even brighter than usual, perhaps thanks to the vivid flowers.::
34289::$$$message_0262_0004_0000$$$::"Sakura, did you want to show me these cherry trees?"[lr]::
34290::$$$message_0262_0004_0001$$$::"Yes, as you can see.[lr]::
34291::$$$message_0262_0004_0002$$$::They're out of season, but these children have been dormant for years. They're late bloomers.[lr]::
34292::$$$message_0262_0004_0003$$$::Oh, I guess it's weird to call them children, when they're so much older than me."::
34293::$$$message_0262_0005_0000$$$::"Hm? Are they that old?"[lr]::
34294::$$$message_0262_0005_0001$$$::"Yes. They were planted well before I was born.[lr]::
34295::$$$message_0262_0005_0002$$$::My grandmother planted them, so I should call them grand-aunts."::
34296::$$$message_0262_0006_0000$$$::I see.[lr]::
34297::$$$message_0262_0006_0001$$$::It makes sense she'd want to show me when they haven't bloomed in such a long time.::
34298::$$$message_0262_0007_0000$$$::"That isn't all.[lr]::
34299::$$$message_0262_0007_0001$$$::Actually, this cherry tree has never bloomed before."[lr]::
34300::$$$message_0262_0007_0002$$$::"What? If your grandma planted it, then they must be over fifty years old. And they've never bloomed once?"::
34301::$$$message_0262_0008_0000$$$::"...That's right. They were called unblooming flowers, and nobody took care of them.[lr]::
34302::$$$message_0262_0008_0001$$$::But now, they're blooming strong. They [font italic=true]want[font italic=false] to bloom."[lr]::
34303::$$$message_0262_0008_0002$$$::"..."::
